<title>SWITZERLAND: Baloise H1 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Baloise H1 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half to June</p>
<p>30, 1996. (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group net			109		 95.8*</p>
<p> Premium income		  **		 4,121.4*</p>
<p>NOTE- Company name is BALOISE Versicherungs-Gruppe. Company to release full semi-annual report including consolidated balance sheet and profit and loss on Oct 3, 1996.</p>
<p>* figure reported October 5, 1995.</p>
<p>** Company gave no absolute figure in latest half-year but said premium income rose two percent compared with comparable 1995 period.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial, +41 1 631 7340</p>
